          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉડાન (uḍān) is built on ઊડવું, \"to fly\", a tadbhava of Sanskrit uḍḍīyatē, \"flies up\" (CDIAL 1697): the flying itself, and then the journey by air."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
