          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ચકરાવો (cakrāvo) seems to be built on Sanskrit cakra, \"a wheel\" (Monier-Williams): a round that a plane, a bird or a traveller makes before coming down or going on."
            }
